    "Cloudflare Access returned 302 before the Worker on production /admin and /admin/github/callback; liveAdminWorkerCsp=not_observed_access_protected, adminCspSource=exact_source_function. Checking the exact deployed source function does not establish observation of live admin Worker CSP.",
    "The first production before-backup failed restore and passed cleanup; only the second successful set was bound, without overwriting the failure. The first public smoke failed on an unexpected redirect after 6 passing checks; after a separate kit correction, the second attempt passed 14 checks.",
    "Health, Worker binding, backup creation, timers and GitHub Deployments retain their original evidence times; staging deployment health has no separate timestamp, and the final observation time is not substituted.",
